OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial garden opens for
OL,4,ASunderland fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club has opened a permanent
OL,7,Fwalled garden for fans to commemorate
OL,8,Floved ones who have passed away.
OL,10,FSunderland AFC opened the site, near
OL,11,Fthe Stadium of Light's Jimmy Montgomery
OL,12,Fstand, on Saturday, alongside
OL,13,Fsupporters' group Heaven Branch.
OL,15,FThe group's founder Joanne Youngson
OL,16,Fsaid the garden had been filled with
OL,17,Fearth that had been removed from inside
OL,18,Fthe stadium.
OL,20,FShe said local people had such a
OL,21,F"special connection" to the club in
OL,22,Fboth life and death.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
